  "summary": "Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer (AI &amp; Product focused) with 4+ years of experience architecting and shipping high-impact, scalable applications. Expert in a modern web stack, leveraging JavaScript, TypeScript, React, and Vue.js for robust frontend development, complemented by deep backend capabilities in Python, Java, and AWS serverless architectures. A technical generalist with a proven track record in LLM deployment, championing development best practices (TDD, automated testing), and utilizing MBA-backed business acumen to own feature roadmaps, drive scaling, and ensure profitability. Passionate about bridging the gap between cutting-edge AI technologies and user-centric product development.",
